Z||000001||Mach10||08-23-2001||08:42 PM||||Very unfortunate.<P>Even more unfortunate is the fact that this is percieved as the major problem with having government healthcare; no room. In fact, this is what happens when there is a shift, and facilities set up under a health-care system are moving towards an HMO system. This is what happens when a government backs out of a healthcare system. Tragic. <BR>We need our funding put back into healthcare. ||||reg||9
