Z||000003||AkursedX||08-23-2001||08:48 PM||||Geez, that story bothers me too because it tells me that the burn unit rooms even in the Buffalo area are full  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif">  <P>Looks like I better stop playing with fire so much.......<P>Oh crap!  I just realized that I've got to do welding on my other Fiero's frame this weekend!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif">  And knowing my luck, I'm as good as dead!  Nice knowing all of you  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>------------------<BR><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpic2_2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
